"The Plant's not a sage,\nNeither is it a machine,\nIt requires heed and so,\nBut without any sarcastic grin.\n\nThe heed it need,\nIs something natural,\nLike the sunshine of the Sun,\nWhich do not leave it delusional.\n\nLike the UV torch,\nWhich pretends to be the Sun,\nShows transient photons,\nAnd goes to the UV's chosen.\n\nYes The Plant want to transpire,\nThe droplets are just dried out,\nThe water goes to build The Plant,\nNot to some puny spout.\n\nThe Plant won't BEG for it,\nIt can grow without the torch,\nThe Sun will always be there,\nAnd it won't let it scorch."